<title>USA: Instrumentation sees rise in reveune.</title>
<headline>Instrumentation sees rise in reveune.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Instrumentation Laboratory S.p.A. said that revenue, in Lira, for the first two months of fiscal 1997 is expected to increase about 9 percent versus the comparable period of fiscal 1996.  This estimated revenue includes the contribution from the company's two recent acquisitions completed during the fourth quarter of fiscal 1996.</p>
